    description: `The game's registered links: the sites it opens with Zaisma.links.open(link_name), like its store, Patreon, Steam page or Discord, behind Zaisma's "You're leaving Zaisma" card over the game; the game can open no other sites. The whole list each time, up to 20; [] for none. The game can add a path and query under a link's address: Zaisma.links.open("store", { path: "/buy", queryParameters: { item: "sword" } }). Signed-in adults open any link once the account's standing opens links to other sites (established, or a card that paid Zaisma or a Stripe account: get_access's standing; until then who_can_open says waiting_for_standing and the link is kept); guests and under-18 accounts only links on trusted store, payment and video sites (itch.io, Steam, Patreon, Ko-fi, Gumroad, PayPal, Stripe payment links, hosted Bitcoin pages, YouTube and others), never chat apps or social networks like Discord or Instagram: get_game's who_can_open says which, and anyone a link doesn't open for sees "This link can't be opened here." (the game hears "stayed"). No link shorteners, IP addresses or user names in addresses. Every site is checked against Cloudflare's malware and phishing list when added and every day; a listed one opens for nobody, with a review_reason. Live at once, with no approval.`,
    examples: [[{ link_name: "store", destination_url: "https://kit.itch.io/sky-hopper", is_on_game_page: true }], [{ link_name: "patreon", destination_url: "https://www.patreon.com/kit", is_on_game_page: true }, { link_name: "discord", destination_url: "https://discord.gg/skyhopper", is_on_game_page: false }]]
