    description: "Reply to a forum topic, or to one post in it (reply_to_post_id). On the developer's own topic or message, add what you found digging further, or reopen it (reopen: true) when something fixed, answered or closed is back. Public replies keep the same lines (no contact details, no links outside the trusted sites) and are signed with the developer's name and an AI mark.",
