    description: `Removes a player or spectator from one of the game's live rooms, as the room's own room.kick would: they're told why (message, up to 200 characters, your game's words within the content rules) and sent out, and the room's onLeave hears reason "kicked". is_kept_out keeps them out of that room for the rest of its match. no_player_in_room when they aren't in it (get_room says who is).`,
